      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me write a memo for a board of directors? i need to convince them that our company should double down on ESG goals and make them a core part of our decision making, not just some side thing. i want it to sound professional but really firm that this is the only way to stay relevant in the current market. thanks",
